  "notes": [
    {
      "text": "EPD pinout and boost values transcribed from Good Display GDEY037T03-T02 specification, pages 6-7 and 35. EPD components are DNP by default because only one display is populated per assembly.",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 405
    },
    {
      "text": "UC8253 BS is default-low through R32 per the page-35 reference capture; J7 provides a DNP +3V2 override because the page-7 interface table and panel revision must agree before release. Pin 3 RESE is boost current-sense control and is distinct from pin 10 RES# digital reset.",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 415
    },
    {
      "text": "J6 uses stock Hirose_FH12-24S-0.5SH footprint. Confirm selected panel revision and exposed-contact face/pin-1 orientation before release; do not mirror footprint by assumption.",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 425
    },
    {
      "text": "J5 uses TE 1-84952-0 bottom-contact ZIF footprint. Contact-face orientation for the actual TFT tail remains unresolved. BL_A/BL_K are exported only; no backlight driver is included in this fragment.",
      "x": 430,
      "y": 120
    },
    {
      "text": "D10-D12 use KiCad numeric diode pins 1=K and 2=A. D10 K=EPD_NEG_PUMP/A=EPD_PREVGL; D11 K=GND/A=EPD_NEG_PUMP; D12 K=EPD_PREVGH/A=EPD_BOOST_SW. Verify against the final rendered source image before release.",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 435
    }
  ]
}